# Optional Advanced Requirements

* GUI using Tkinter
* Web version using Flask/Django
* Dark mode UI
* Real-time password strength meter
* Breached password detection API
* Multi-user authentication support

---

# Expected Outcome

The project should:

* Analyze password security
* Generate stronger passwords
* Teach basic cryptography concepts
* Improve understanding of authentication systems
